<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Glory, Glory! Living by the Lord,</l><l>Walking by the Spirit in His Word!</l><l>Failure’s turned to vict’ry,</l><l>Sighing’s turned to praise.</l><l>Glory! Glory! Living by the Lord!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
